---
title: "All schemas below live in one shared PostgreSQL instance and database — \"ucms\" — isolated from each other by per-service database roles, not separate databases. Solid boxes/edges = built and running today; dashed boxes/edges = planned only — 4 of these services have zero code, and no event ever flows through the Message Broker today because nothing publishes or consumes one yet."
---
flowchart TB
    GW["API Gateway<br/>routing (path-prefix) + CORS only —<br/>no auth, no rate limiting"]

    IAM["1. Identity and Access Service<br/>Login, Users, Roles and Permissions,<br/>RBAC scope assignments, Profile"]
    IAMSCHEMA[("ucms.identity_access")]
    IAM --- IAMSCHEMA

    ACAD["2. Academic Structure Service<br/>Calendar, Programs, Curriculum, Catalog, Offerings"]
    ACADSCHEMA[("ucms.academic")]
    ACAD --- ACADSCHEMA

    REF["7. Reference Data Service<br/>Faculties, Departments, Grading Scales, Categories"]
    REFSCHEMA[("ucms.reference_data")]
    REF --- REFSCHEMA

    ENR["3. Enrollment Service<br/>(planned — no code exists)"]
    ENRSCHEMA[("ucms.enrollment<br/>schema reserved, no tables")]
    ENR -.- ENRSCHEMA

    GRADE["4. Assignment and Grading Service<br/>(planned — no code exists)"]
    GRADESCHEMA[("ucms.assignment_grading<br/>schema reserved, no tables")]
    GRADE -.- GRADESCHEMA

    NOTIF["5. Notification Service<br/>(planned — no code exists)"]
    NOTIFSCHEMA[("ucms.notification<br/>schema reserved, no tables")]
    NOTIF -.- NOTIFSCHEMA

    ANALYTICS["6. Analytics and Reporting Service<br/>(planned — no code exists)"]
    ANALYTICSSCHEMA[("ucms.analytics<br/>schema reserved, no tables")]
    ANALYTICS -.- ANALYTICSSCHEMA

    GW --> IAM
    GW --> ACAD
    GW --> REF
    GW -.->|planned| ENR
    GW -.->|planned| GRADE
    GW -.->|planned| NOTIF
    GW -.->|planned| ANALYTICS

    ACAD -->|"periodic background sync (every 60s)<br/>of role/permission catalog — RestClient<br/>GET /roles, not a per-request call"| IAM

    ENR -.->|planned: validates| ACAD
    ACAD -.->|planned: resolves| REF
    GRADE -.->|planned: validates| ENR
    GRADE -.->|planned: resolves| REF

    MQ{{"Message Broker — RabbitMQ<br/>container runs, but zero application<br/>code publishes or consumes any event today"}}
    ENR -.-> MQ
    GRADE -.-> MQ
    ACAD -.-> MQ
    IAM -.-> MQ
    MQ -.-> NOTIF
    MQ -.-> ANALYTICS

    ANALYTICS -.->|planned: reads| IAM
    ANALYTICS -.->|planned: reads| ACAD
    ANALYTICS -.->|planned: reads| ENR
    ANALYTICS -.->|planned: reads| GRADE

    classDef schema fill:#FBEEDC,stroke:#B4791F,color:#161B29
    classDef schemaPlanned fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#9CA3AF,color:#6B7280,stroke-dasharray: 5 3
    classDef svcBuilt fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#3450D6,stroke-width:2px,color:#161B29
    classDef svcPlanned fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#9CA3AF,color:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray: 5 3
    classDef gateway fill:#E4E8FC,color:#161B29,stroke:#3450D6
    classDef async fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#9CA3AF,color:#6B7280,stroke-dasharray: 5 3

    class IAMSCHEMA,ACADSCHEMA,REFSCHEMA schema
    class ENRSCHEMA,GRADESCHEMA,NOTIFSCHEMA,ANALYTICSSCHEMA schemaPlanned
    class IAM,ACAD,REF svcBuilt
    class ENR,GRADE,NOTIF,ANALYTICS svcPlanned
    class GW gateway
    class MQ async
